    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n          <span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>CI/CD Platform on Kubernetes</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Let 5,000 engineers push code and have it built, tested, signed and safely rolled out to production in minutes - with no shared snowflake build servers, no long-lived cloud keys, and a bad release rolled back automatically before most users notice.</p>\n      "
